      "statement": "api_tokens stores each MCP key twice — a Fernet-encrypted full token for disclosure via the console and a unique bcrypt token_hash plus token_prefix for verification — while allowed_projects and scopes are JSON-array text columns whose null allowed_projects means access to all projects.",
