    {
      "id": "claim_86540dd129bf4a5ebdf11a6067362563",
      "statement": "The api container's CMD runs python -m src.dbs.migrate before starting uvicorn, and migrate_database() is a raw sqlite3 script that no-ops with a warning when data/devops.db does not exist, leaving fresh databases to SQLAlchemy create_all.",
